cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SpeechMate in your research or project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SpeechMate — Endangered Language Learning Platform"
abstract: >
  SpeechMate is an offline-first Flutter application for learning endangered
  tribal languages of the Andaman and Nicobar Islands — specifically Nicobarese
  and Great Andamanese. It features a 10-stage offline NLP pipeline, SM-2
  spaced repetition system, CRDT-based mesh sync, on-device Whisper ASR,
  a first-of-its-kind Nicobarese IME keyboard, and 3,400+ documented
  vocabulary entries compiled with community participation.
authors:
